# CREDITS — Still Lit

A 40-second film in the Urban Sketch · Pen & Wash style, made entirely in code.
Pigeon & Third is an invented corner: no real street, café, or person is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score for this film (`music/score.py`).
Nylon guitar is physically modelled (`core/audio/pluck.py`).
Upright piano: VSCO 2 CE (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner), CC0 1.0
(https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE).

## Typefaces
- Caveat — SIL Open Font License 1.1, Impallari Type
  (https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/caveat). File in `fonts/`.

## Picture
Every frame is drawn by this film's pen-and-wash code (`engine.js`, `scene.js`).
No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.

## Sound effects
All foley is synthesised for this film (`mix.py`): paper room, pen on paper,
wet brush, street air, cup, chair, footsteps, lamp tick.
